@startuml
title State Diagram 2 - Payment Process

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 120
skinparam ranksep 120

[*] --> EnteringDetails : payment dialog opens
EnteringDetails : entry/show amount due

Processing -up-> EnteringDetails : payment declined\nor refused
EnteringDetails --> EnteringDetails : invalid card details\n/ show error
EnteringDetails --> Processing : valid card submitted
EnteringDetails -right-> Abandoned : customer cancels\nor closes dialog

Processing : entry/disable form
Processing : do/charge card
Processing : exit/enable form

Processing --> Paid : payment approved\nor nothing due

Paid : entry/confirm reservation
Abandoned : entry/release seat

Paid --> [*]
Abandoned --> [*]

@enduml
